+            # a row's intermediate.  Per row r the FC1 output is [gate(I) | up(I)]
+            # (fc1_cols = 2I) and rot_scales_flat[r] = [svh_gate(I)|svh_up(I)|
+            # suh_down(I)] (3I fp16).  Applies:
+            #   ig2 = had128(gate) * svh_gate ;  iu2 = had128(up) * svh_up
